 large bedrooms and 2 full baths. The large entry opens up to a welcoming kitchen that has ample storage and counter space. Dining area is just off the kitchen and leads into the spacious and bright living room. Suite includes a large terrace / balcony with Southwest views. The large primary bedroom has a 3pc ensuite and lots of closet space. A second bedroom, 4pc main bathroom, storage closet and walk-in Pantry completes the Suite. Parking is Covered and has a powered stall included. Building Laundry is conveniently located on each floor. Building amenities include a Swimming Pool, Hottub and Sauna. Enjoy the nearby parks/playgrounds, river valley trails and scenery around in this amazing community. Numerous upgrades and condo fees include heat and water. Whitemud drive is easily accessible only a minute away and only 15 Mins to the U of A by car or Transit. (id:67522)","facts":[["Price","$159,900"],["Type","Condo"],["Bedrooms","2"],["Bathrooms","2"],["Living area","1,094 sq ft"],["Lot size","1,850 sq ft"],["Year built","1978"],["Condo fee","$773 monthly"],["Neighbourhood","Brander Gardens"],["Town","Edmonton"],["Postal code","T6H5K5"],["MLS® number","E4486755"],["Listed","May 9, 2026"]],"features":[["Appliances","Refrigerator, Dishwasher, Stove, Hood Fan, Window Coverings"],["Heating","Baseboard heaters"],["Parking","Stall"],["Condo fee includes","Common Area Maintenance, Exterior Maintenance, Property Management, Heat, Water, Insurance, Other, See Remarks"]],"rooms":[["Living room","Main level","5.61 m × 3.71 m (18'5\" × 12'2\")"],["Dining room","Main level","3.41 m × 2.77 m (11'2\" × 9'1\")"],["Kitchen","Main level","2.47 m × 2.64 m (8'1\" × 8'8\")"],["Primary Bedroom","Main level","3.41 m × 4.49 m (11'2\" × 14'9\")"],["Bedroom 2","Main level","2.91 m × 3.41 m (9'7\" × 11'2\")"]],"courtesy":"Chris Broadhurst, REMAX River City","board":"REALTORS® Association of Edmonton","town_slug":"edmonton","hood_slug":"brander-gardens","area":"southwest-edmonton"}